kobuild recipes and scripts use the MIT license in LICENSE.

The SDK images include third-party software under its own licenses.

Qt5 uses the pinned NickelTC image in qt5/Dockerfile. Its upstream recipes,
patches and source references are available at https://github.com/pgaskin/NickelTC.

Qt6 builds the official archive recorded in qt6/source/source.json with the
included patches. Copyright and license notices for those patches are in
qt6/source/NOTICE and qt6/source/LICENSES. These terms are not replaced by MIT.

Qt license texts are included in /usr/share/doc/kobuild/qt-licenses inside both
images. Ubuntu package notices remain in /usr/share/doc. The repository records
SDK build inputs; it is not a complete source archive for every inherited
system package or compiler component.

Application-specific dependencies and patches are not included.
